div.p:
French:	Je pense que oui. (

 I think that yes

)	Je pense que non. (

 I think that no.

)

Spanish:	Creo que sí. (

 I believe that yes.

)	Creo que no. (

 I believe that no.

)

German:	Ich denke ja. (

 I think yes.

)		Ich denke nicht. (

 I think not.

)

Hindi:	Meri soch se. (

 From my thought

)		Yeh meri soch nahin hai.

(

 This is not what I think.

)
